# POI game

Follow `AGENTS.md` and `RULES.md` before changing this repo.

- Change only what was asked. Reuse helpers that already exist.
- Do not invent latency numbers, partitioning, a trained model, or an accuracy score.
- The consensus rule in `AGENTS.md` is the target design. It is not live code yet.
- Do not show exact distance before submit. Keep the search radius at 150 meters unless the owner says otherwise.
- Do not add a paid maps product, a training job, or a new data store unless the owner asks.
- Do not commit `.env`, the Word lock file, or secrets.
- Do not mention AI, or the name of any AI tool, in a commit, pull request, release note, or in the code. Author and committer stay the owner's name and email only.
